{"id":"n89052-1-7","stage":3,"title":"한층 · 更加","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89052-1-7-1","ko":"지수야, 못 본 사이에 한층 더 예뻐졌네.","zh":"智秀啊，好久不见，你变得更漂亮了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"본","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이에","meaning":"间，之间，……的时候","explanation":"사이：间，之间，……的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"2","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한층","meaning":"更加，进一步","explanation":"한층：更加，进一步","readings":[{"term":"한층","audio":"/audio/08b9eef27da9fa832337.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89052","senseId":"1","lemma":"한층","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예뻐졌네.","meaning":"漂亮，好看；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，……的时候","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从某一时刻到另一个时刻的时间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"08b9eef27da9fa83","term":"한층","zh":"更加，进一步","audio":"/audio/08b9eef27da9fa832337.mp3","entryId":"89052","definition":"在一定程度上更深一步。","pronunciation":["한층"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c7909d0fd77ed2eaeb1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89052-1-7-2","ko":"그래? 운동을 했더니 뭔가 달라 보이나 봐.","zh":"是吗？看来做了运动之后看起来有点不一样啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했더니","meaning":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","explanation":"하다：表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭔가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달라","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이나","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；나：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示前句所指的事实为后句的理由或根据。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/610fc2145be66737a2b7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.052,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89052","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":112,"sequenceScore":2.8787,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？看来做了运动之后看起来有点不一样啊。","我最近身体特别酸痛。","智秀啊，好久不见，你变得更漂亮了呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？看来做了运动之后看起来有点不一样啊。","智秀啊，好久不见，你变得更漂亮了呢。","我最近身体特别酸痛。"],"answer":0}]}
